よ。","variant_male_record_index":"105681","variant_female_record_index":"105682","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1026224011:1":{"text":"ありがとうございます！これなら、アウロラさんもすぐに目覚めるはずです。","source_cn":"太好了，有你的帮助，奥萝菈小姐肯定很快就能苏醒。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xED5F83F7305BF684","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ありがとうございます！これなら、アウロラさんもすぐに目覚めるはずです。","female":"ありがとうございます！これなら、アウロラさんもすぐに目覚めるはずです。","variant_male_record_index":"105683","variant_female_record_index":"105684","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:0:1":{"text":"今度は僕が彼女を助ける番だな。","source_cn":"当然，她帮了我很多","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA5DBFFA1AF9586BC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"今度は僕が彼女を助ける番だな。","female":"今度は私が彼女を助ける番ね。","variant_male_record_index":"60494","variant_female_record_index":"60495","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:1:2":{"text":"急いで夢境の羽を集めるよ。","source_cn":"我会尽快收集梦境羽毛的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x19F8519C87379908","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"急いで夢境の羽を集めるよ。","female":"急いで夢境の羽を集めるわ。","variant_male_record_index":"60496","variant_female_record_index":"60497","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"自然に目覚めるのを待つしかないのか？","source_cn":"只能等她自己苏醒吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x902977B63DD23F9B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"自然に目覚めるのを待つしかないのか？","female":"自然に目覚めるのを待つしかないの？","variant_male_record_index":"60490","variant_female_record_index":"60491","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_c